/-!
# Theorem 10.35.11

@stack 00FU

For a field `k` and a `k`-algebra generated by fewer than `#k` elements, maximal-ideal residue
fields are algebraic over `k`, and the algebra is Jacobson.
-/

/- Theorem 10.35.11 (1): algebraicity of maximal-ideal residue fields. -/
@[stacks 00FU "(1), algebraic residue fields"]
#check @Algebra.IsAlgebraic.residueField_of_adjoin_eq_top_of_cardinalMk_lt

/- Theorem 10.35.11 (2): the Jacobson-ring conclusion. -/
@[stacks 00FU "(2), Jacobson ring"]
#check @IsJacobsonRing.of_adjoin_eq_top_of_cardinalMk_lt
